## Instructions:
1. Provide the complete code for the component without placeholders, `// ... rest of code`, or omissions.
2. Recommend placing the component in `components/auto-index/evilcharts-hover-trace-bar-chart/hover-trace-bar-chart.tsx` (or the appropriate modular directory).
